#: ../../docs/convention/gid.md:1 fab9ffc0ba164a5084c7790d9c5ee6a4
msgid "Global ID (gid)"
msgstr "全局 ID（gid）"

#: ../../docs/convention/gid.md:3 b9d5a4f74b544876879b495e5e429483
msgid ""
"To uniquely locate each detector element, Pybes3 defines a global ID "
"(gid). The gid starts from 0 and increases sequentially along the "
"detector elements. The increasing order is described by a tuple-like "
"structure."
msgstr "为唯一定位每个探测器元素，Pybes3 定义了全局 ID（gid）。gid 从 0 开始，沿探测器元素顺序递增，递增顺序用一个类似元组的结构描述。"

#: ../../docs/convention/gid.md:5 ba9fde530b46446d8266883d813be03f
msgid ""
"For example, the MDC gid follows the order `(layer, wire)`, meaning it "
"increases first along `wire`, then along `layer`:"
msgstr "例如 MDC 的 gid 按 `(layer, wire)` 的顺序排列，即先沿 `wire` 递增，再沿 `layer` 递增："

#: ../../docs/convention/gid.md:18 0d70f8f2733a4b2e817d6fe97f6a3e18
msgid ""
"This section only describes the numbering scheme of global ID (gid) for "
"each detector. For how to parse and calculate gid, see the [MDC](../user-"
"manual/mdc.md), [TOF](../user-manual/tof.md), [EMC](../user-"
"manual/emc.md), [CGEM](../user-manual/cgem.md) pages."
msgstr ""
"本节只描述各探测器的全局 ID（gid）编号方案。如何解析与计算 gid，请见 [MDC](../user-manual/mdc.md)、[TOF"
"](../user-manual/tof.md)、[EMC](../user-manual/emc.md)、[CGEM](../user-"
"manual/cgem.md) 页面。"

